parser, scaffold, runtime tool, methodology doc, MCP tool
descriptions, and this project's own `brain.aide` all conform.
Tests are 847 green project-wide; `tsc --noEmit` is exit 0.

**The structural-followup cycle that ran 2026-04-26 was UNVERIFIED
and is being reviewed.** Two surfaces are resolved (architect +
auditor reverted to HEAD). One major architectural change is
queued for the next pipeline cycle (four-section brain.aide schema +
new study-playbook entry-point artifact). Three surfaces remain
unverified (`.claude/commands/aide/aide.aide`, `.claude/.aide`,
