**`aide_info`'s outdated flag is meaningless in this repo.** This
package is the canonical source for every artifact under
`.claude/agents/`, `.claude/commands/`, `.claude/skills/`, and
`.aide/docs/`. The `outdated` array compares the host's
`.aide/versions.json` against the manifest shipped with the npm
package — but in THIS repo, the local files ARE what ships next.
Any post-publish edit shows as "outdated" even though it is the
new source of truth. Ignore the outdated array when working in
this repo.

